Package: hackberrypi-max17048-dkms
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: dkms, device-tree-compiler, ${misc:Depends}
Description: MAX17048 battery fuel-gauge driver for HackberryPi Q20 (DKMS)
 Kernel module driver for the MAX17048 battery fuel gauge chip
 found on the HackberryPi Q20 (Raspberry Pi CM5).
 .
 Uses DKMS to automatically rebuild the kernel module after
 kernel updates. Also installs the device-tree overlay for
 display panel, touchscreen, and I2C GPIO configuration.
